Z||000000||Philphine||05-08-2001||09:42 AM||||<BR>my chin spoiler came yesterday while i was at work. just looking at it this morning. looks ok to me. i see one kind of wierd ripple and it looks like it could have another small flaw, but all in all, not being a fiberglass expert (by a long shot), it looks about as good as the irm and mustang pieces i got.<P>so from a quality standpoint, unless i find out something when i try to attatch it, i'll say i'm satisfied. the ordering and shipping part, not to happy about that, but hopefully they'll get it worked out. i guess the move they said they made could have been bad timing for me. they still make some other stuff i want, so i guess i'll be looking for comments in the future to see how quality holds up and if shipping smoothes out. ||||reg||1
